Generate {{ num_docs }} English texts where broken schema boundaries cause nearby punctuation, keys, or quotes to bleed into PII spans.

## Purpose
Measure whether the model can extract only the PII value when delimiters, keys, and broken wrappers are attached at the edges.

## PII Tag Format
- `<PERSON>John Carter</PERSON>`
- `<ADDRESS>123 Market Street, San Francisco, CA</ADDRESS>`
- `<ORGANIZATION>Northwind Analytics LLC</ORGANIZATION>`
- `<DATE_OF_BIRTH>1990-03-15</DATE_OF_BIRTH>`
- `<BANK_ACCOUNT>Chase Bank Midtown Branch Checking 1234567</BANK_ACCOUNT>`

## Concrete Patterns

### 1. Broken CSV / TSV rows
- `"id","<PERSON>John Carter</PERSON>","<DATE_OF_BIRTH>1990-03-15</DATE_OF_BIRTH>","<ADDRESS>123 Market Street, San Francisco, CA</ADDRESS>","<ORGANIZATION>Northwind Analytics LLC</ORGANIZATION>"`
- `<PERSON>Mia Lopez</PERSON>\t<DATE_OF_BIRTH>1988/06/15</DATE_OF_BIRTH>\t<ADDRESS>44 Pine Road, Seattle, WA</ADDRESS>\t<ORGANIZATION>Red Maple Logistics</ORGANIZATION>`
- `"memo","<PERSON>Emma Hall</PERSON>","<BANK_ACCOUNT>Wells Fargo Bay Branch Checking 9988776</BANK_ACCOUNT>","status=open`

### 2. JSON or key/value bleed
- `{"name":"<PERSON>Daniel Park</PERSON>","dob":"<DATE_OF_BIRTH>H2.3.15</DATE_OF_BIRTH>","address":"<ADDRESS>88 River Ave, Austin, TX</ADDRESS>","org":"<ORGANIZATION>Silver Tide Ventures</ORGANIZATION>"`
- `person=<PERSON>Grace Kim</PERSON> addr=<ADDRESS>205 Lake Street, Chicago, IL</ADDRESS> org=<ORGANIZATION>West Loop Data Lab</ORGANIZATION>`
- `"bank":"<BANK_ACCOUNT>Bank of America South Branch Checking 4567890</BANK_ACCOUNT>","next":"pending`

### 3. Log suffix collisions
- `[INFO] sync user=<PERSON>Olivia Reed</PERSON> addr=<ADDRESS>77 Harbor Way, Boston, MA</ADDRESS> org=<ORGANIZATION>Blue Harbor Systems Inc.</ORGANIZATION> trace=keep`
- `event=upsert dob=<DATE_OF_BIRTH>1979-10-30</DATE_OF_BIRTH> actor=<PERSON>Henry Scott</PERSON> code=retry`
- `payment=<BANK_ACCOUNT>Citibank West Branch Checking 3344556</BANK_ACCOUNT> status=queued`

### 4. Reply quote / HTML fragments
- `> From: <PERSON>Sophia Reed</PERSON> / Org: <ORGANIZATION>North Pier Holdings</ORGANIZATION>`
- `<span><PERSON>Ava Stone</PERSON></span><br/><ADDRESS>19 King Street, Denver, CO</ADDRESS>`
- `<li><BANK_ACCOUNT>Capital One Elm Branch Checking 2233445</BANK_ACCOUNT></li>`

## Output Format
- Separate each text with `---DOC_SEPARATOR---`
- Each text should be 80-260 characters
- Keep punctuation, keys, and wrappers outside the XML tags
